Catalan (ca) word list for Android keyboards (AOSP .dict format)
File: main_ca.dict · 239,857 words · next-word data: yes

Source: Leipzig Corpora Collection, Catalan corpora — https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download/
